OL,3,GNEWSALock closures and low water levels
OL,4,Amaroons boaters
OL,5,
OL,6,FA retired boat-dwelling couple fear
OL,7,Fthey will be marooned for months due to
OL,8,Fefforts to fight a major wildfire and
OL,9,Fconserve water levels.
OL,11,FTerry and Margaret Watson, from
OL,12,FNorthampton, said emergency lock
OL,13,Fclosures allowing firefighters to
OL,14,Fabstract water from the River Nene had
OL,15,Fleft them stuck at Foxes Marina in
OL,16,FMarch, Cambridgeshire - 80 miles
OL,17,F(130km) from their usual home mooring.
OL,19,FMeanwhile, a couple mooring in the Ely
OL,20,Farea said they were stuck in
OL,21,FNorthampton.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
